  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Calculating Mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Variance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>43</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;(where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;must have solution as&nbsp;natural numbers</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;always has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> at unit place for any value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;can&#39;t be perfect square</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;can&#39;t be integer.</p>"
